Logical connection between evidence and claim

pdai/collections/ocr_catalog.yaml — data root on PDAI-1, tmp directory, viewer port and engine_chain of the collection;
pdai/collections/&lt;c&gt;/config/cure.yaml — what the catalog does not hold (instructions, rules, engine keys, reject codes, normalizer module, budget);
&lt;data&gt;/status.json — the corpus readiness written by pdai-complete.


